# Cursor Rules — Bridge to AGENTS.md
# Cursor reads this file automatically as .cursorrules
# All rules live in AGENTS.md — this just imports them.

Read the file AGENTS.md in this repository root. Follow everything in it.
Read HANDOFF.md before starting any work session.
Read docs/DECISIONS.md before making any architectural decisions.

## Summary of non-negotiables (full rules in AGENTS.md + GLOBAL-RULES.md):
- Never default to lazy tech choices — always research industry standards
- Never say "out of scope" — search GitHub for open-source alternatives first  
- All testing done by an adversarial sub-agent, not the dev agent
- Expensive models = planning + review only; cheap models = generate + test + summarize
- Every session ends with HANDOFF.md updated + commit + push
- Repetitive tasks → scripts; repeated requests → rules
- Ideas captured in IDEAS.md without interrupting flow

## AI Commands (respond to these immediately, no confirmation needed):
- "morning brief" → read all HANDOFF.md files, show project dashboard
- "wrap up" → read git diff, update HANDOFF.md, commit, push
- "capture idea: [text]" → append to OMNI-HELPER/IDEAS.md
- "project status" → show current HANDOFF.md next steps
- "what should i work on" → read HANDOFF.md, propose best next action
